"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"At least 626 people have died after flash floods hit the Nepal-Tibet border on Wednesday. The floods caused a lot of damage, and some of the most dramatic footage is not being shown in China.\",            \"english_title\": \"Floods in Nepal-Tibet\",            \"translated_version\": \"Al menos 626 personas murieron despu\u00e9s de que inundaciones r\u00e1pidas golpearon la frontera de Nepal-T\u00edbet el mi\u00e9rcoles. Las inundaciones causaron mucho da\u00f1o, y algunos de los videos m\u00e1s dram\u00e1ticos no se muestran en China.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Inundaciones en Nepal-T\u00edbet\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Mourners gathered outside the palace to remember a beloved king. Royals, politicians, and citizens came together to honor him. His son has taken on the family motto 'all for Norway'.\",            \"english_title\": \"Remembering a Beloved King\",            \"translated_version\": \"Personas se reunieron fuera del palacio para recordar a un rey querido. Reales, pol\u00edticos y ciudadanos se juntaron para honrarlo. Su hijo ha tomado el lema de la familia 'todo por Noruega'.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Recordando a un Rey Querido\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"An investigation has started into how weapons for Ukraine's military were stored near a residential area. This is a concern because it could be dangerous for people living nearby.\",            \"english_title\": \"Investigation on Weapon Storage\",            \"translated_version\": \"Una investigaci\u00f3n ha comenzado sobre c\u00f3mo se guardaron armas para el ej\u00e9rcito de Ucrania cerca de una zona residencial. Esto es preocupante porque podr\u00eda ser peligroso para las personas que viven cerca.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Investigaci\u00f3n sobre Almacenamiento de Armas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A woman who rented homes to two al-Qaeda members has spoken publicly for the first time. She shared her story with the BBC.\",            \"english_title\": \"Woman Speaks About Al-Qaeda\",            \"translated_version\": \"Una mujer que alquil\u00f3 casas a dos miembros de al-Qaeda ha hablado p\u00fablicamente por primera vez. Ella comparti\u00f3 su historia con la BBC.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Mujer Habla sobre Al-Qaeda\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Turbulent international affairs have caused an election to be held earlier than planned. However, the campaign is focusing more on Iceland's important fishing industry.\",            \"english_title\": \"Early Election in Iceland\",            \"translated_version\": \"Asuntos internacionales turbulentos han causado que una elecci\u00f3n se realice antes de lo planeado. Sin embargo, la campa\u00f1a se est\u00e1 enfocando m\u00e1s en la importante industria pesquera de Islandia.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Elecci\u00f3n Temprana en Islandia\"        }    ]}"